config:
  state:
    useMaxWidth: false
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: POST /api/v1/platforms<br/>(is_active=TRUE)

    Active --> Active: PUT — INSERT new row<br/>same id, updated fields

    Active --> Inactive: DELETE — INSERT new row<br/>is_active=FALSE

    Inactive --> Active: POST again — INSERT<br/>new row, is_active=TRUE

    note right of Active
        Latest row: is_active=TRUE.
        --
        Platform can register identifiers.
        Latest-row lookup returns it.
        Platform users authenticate (mTLS).
        Dataset requests → platform.base_url.
        supports_subsetting flag controls
          full-XML vs subset API.
    end note

    note right of Inactive
        Latest row: is_active=FALSE.
        --
        Lookup excludes the platform
          (filter is_active=TRUE).
        Platform-side mTLS auth fails.
        Existing consignment rows stay.
        Non-latest rows archived nightly
          by CronManager.
    end note
